[[Endless Summer]] is a [[unique|non-unique]] [[legendary trinket]] obtainable through [[Visions of Eternity]]. Up to two rings can be stored in the [[Legendary Armory]], allowing for equipping two rings at once, one in each slot.

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|Xuorri was cornered. At last, the [[centaur]] hunters had finally caught up with him. As his enemies lifted their swords, he simply closed his eyes and prayed, "[[Zintl]], light my path and guide me toward the Endless Summer." In that moment, Xuorri was engulfed by a radiant light. The [[hylek]]'s skin warmed under the beams, and when Xuorri opened his eyes, his pursuers writhed on the ground. They had been blinded by the Lifegiver's light, allowing Xuorri a swift escape.}}

